"Advanced Options" = "高级选项";
"Ignore clipboard events received through iOS Continuity’s Universal Clipboard, so Kayoko does not save content copied from nearby Apple devices." = "忽略通过 iOS「连续互通」功能的「通用剪贴板」传来的剪贴板事件，避免 Kayoko 保存附近 Apple 设备复制的内容。";
